📄 CHANNEL DESCRIPTION — v2 (Science-Aligned)

I create calm Scripture audio designed to support healthy bedtime routines.

Not sermons.
Not teaching.
Not performance.

Quiet repetition.

Research consistently shows that predictable bedtime routines, familiar stories, and calm narration help children transition into sleep more easily.
This channel applies those principles using Scripture.

Each video is built to help:

• Children relax through familiar Bible narratives
• Families create consistent, screen-free bedtime rituals
• Parents use repeatable audio that signals sleep
• Listeners access ad-free audio for offline use

The focus is not novelty.
The focus is predictability.

A consistent voice, gentle pacing, and meaningful text create an environment the brain can recognize as safe and restful.

Every video is produced as a reusable audio track so families can return to the same experience each night.

No hype.
No hidden messaging.
No overstimulation.

Just calm narration, soft ambience, and Scripture designed to support sleep.

Recommended primarily for children ages 3–10, with adaptations suitable for family listening and adults who prefer gentle narration.

